        "text_LjwpDq": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>For the first time, we’re naming a full season; Stillness.<br/><br/>As we approach our 5th birthday this November, we wanted to move with intention. We live in a world where everything is moving fast, changing constantly. As creatives committed to our craft, we never want to compromise. This Autumn/Winter collection represents exactly that: intentionality.<br/><br/>It’s a season rooted in stillness. In taking the time to pause, look inward, and create pieces that are true to us. Every garment is a reflection of our time, our dedication, and the design philosophy that’s carried us from the beginning.<br/><br/>So we introduce to you: Stillness.<br/><br/>Reclaiming the energy and the purpose with which we began, and offering it back to you in every detail of this season.<br/><br/>Here we go. Here we begin.</p>"
          }
        }
